{# WHERE EVERYBODY IS — the organisation's ground, with a marker per live
   position.

   THE AREAS REGISTER'S PLATE PLUS THE MARKERS. Every area's boundary is drawn
   — bold where it is running, quiet where it is only mapped — and the live
   layer goes over it. One plate service, so the two pages that draw these
   areas cannot draw them differently.

   NO PLATE WHERE THERE IS NO GROUND. A map of no areas is a map of nothing,
   so an installation with none does not draw one; the figures above it keep
   their slots and say what they could not measure, which is the honest
   report. #}
{% if map is not null %}
    <div class="c" data-w="plate">
        <span class="tab">Where everybody is<span class="src">&middot; <span class="ao-live"><i></i>live</span> &middot; <time datetime="{{ now|date('c') }}" data-localtime-format="stamp">{{ now|date('j M') }} &middot; {{ now|date('H:i') }}</time></span></span>
        <span class="ao-by"><i></i>the organisation&rsquo;s ground &middot; module layers</span>
        {{ render_map(map, {
            '--map-plate-height': 'min(58vh, 560px)',
            'role': 'img',
            'aria-label': 'Every area, and everybody reporting a position',
        }) }}
    </div>
{% endif %}
